	(text "TANK SCALE - NAU7802 24-bit load cell ADC on the I2C bus (address 0x2A)\nJ31: 1=E+ (excitation +)  2=E- (excitation -)  3=S+ (signal +)  4=S- (signal -)  5=cable shield\n6-wire cells: join SENSE+ to E+ and SENSE- to E- at the cell end.\nIf weight reads negative, swap S+ and S- (or fix in software).\nFirmware: AVDD LDO set to 3.0V, PGA cap (C39 on VIN2) enabled, poll CYCLE_READY over I2C (DRDY unused).\nCalibrate in the service menu: known weight for scale factor, tank tare / current contents for zero."(exclude_from_sim no)(at 147.32 129.54 0)(effects(font(size 1.27 1.27))(justify left top))(uuid "0c26efc2-29e7-4a68-9c93-9626c23cf285"))
